{
    "background_story": "In a mystical realm, a dragon named Dream was infamous for his insatiable appetite for treasure. His lair was a hoard of glittering jewels, gold, and magical artifacts, which he guarded with ferocity. Dream's greed knew no bounds; he would stop at nothing to claim the most valuable treasures for himself. His obsession led him to plunder villages, raid merchant caravans, and even steal from other dragons. As his wealth grew, so did his isolation. The other dragons shunned him, and the villagers lived in fear of his wrath. One day, Dream's greed led him to covet a powerful magical crystal, but his pursuit of it ultimately led to his downfall. The crystal's curse trapped him in his own treasure hoard, forever bound to the wealth he had so greedily accumulated.",
